  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="2.3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Northu">Northu</ref> 2.3</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="2.3" corresp="#wit-d">⁊ ælc pr<hi rend="italic">eost</hi> finde hi<hi rend="italic">m</hi> XII festermen, þ<hi rend="italic">æt</hi> he preostlage wille healdan mid rihte.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#whitelock" corresp="#wit-d">And each priest is to provide himself with 12 sureties, that he will rightly observe the priest's law.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#rabin" corresp="#wit-d">And every priest is to find for himself twelve bondmen, that he will properly abide by the priests' law.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Und jeder Priester schaffe sich 12 Bürgen [dáfür], dass er Priestersatzung gesetzmässig halten wolle.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">And let every priest find himself 12 sureties [for this], that he will keep the priests' law lawfully.</ab>
        <note type="editorial">Liebermann's German misprints ‘Priesersatzung’.</note>
      </div>
    </body>
  </text>
